// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// orchestra domain — implementation bindings
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// The reactor binary (wf-runtime::cli::run_cli) drives the full lifecycle.
// Receiver binds to wf-connector-api BatchSource adapters; SinkFactory binds
// alert delivery to wp-connector-api SinkFactory adapters; external() binds to
// the wp-knowledge runtime.

bind Orchestra.EngineEntry to ReactorCliBinary with config
bind Orchestra.Receiver to BatchSourceAdapter with storage
bind Orchestra.SinkFactoryRegistry to ConnectorSinkRegistry with storage
bind Orchestra.ExternalRuntime to KnowledgeBackend with storage
